.terraform/
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins each provider's
# exact version and the checksums `init` verifies downloads against, so a
# fresh clone resolves the same providers rather than whatever the registry
# serves that day, and a tampered download fails loudly instead of quietly
# applying. It is also the prerequisite for serving these providers from a
# local mirror later.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
